        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you ask this, Silence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without our experiments, the child would not have lasted more than a few days after leaving Haydn 1.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We saved her life. She wants for nothing, and will contribute to scientific advancement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How lucky is she, compared to all those children who die of Oripathy in the barrenlands?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_531_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I trusted you, put you in charge of her. Yet you make such petty accusations towards me, towards science itself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Parvis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g5_laboratory",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not a question for me to answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Joyce reminded me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should not judge things by my own standards, even if I can never accept what you did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did we not choose to be tormented by uncertainty and self-doubt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As researchers, it's our duty to seek the answer ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
