    {
        "text": "Is everything ready?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our team has entered the site and is approaching the lab area.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. Get ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Colonel, I know there have been delays, but if you give me a little more time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never told me there were other people at the site, Clooney.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Colonel's Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you mean the pharmaceutical company?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing to worry about. They're partnered with Rhine Lab. I will...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need your promises.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Colonel's Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I need here is results.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Colonel's Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I apologize. This is just a small hiccup...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can't deliver results, then you have to at least stop making trouble for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Colonel's Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd do well to remember that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Colonel's Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we proceed, Director Clooney?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One more thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put me on spec com.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ferdinand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
