        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is everybody out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are they doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They say it's a 'precautionary measure'. Probably a sedative or something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess we made a little too much noise, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget what I said. If anyone asks, I was the one behind everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, no one's letting you take all the credit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sonny Romano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wasn't asking for your name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell your leader that I take sole responsibility for the kidnapping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you gonna get to it after the injection?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
