    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the...? Doc Urbica? Why'd you push me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$plot_intro",
        "key": "$plot_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 40,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't take the shot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_528_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're interfering with our work, researcher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhine Defense Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I developed that stuff in that syringe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Need me to explain what it's for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Aren't they with you and Doc Silence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you always doubt the people you should trust, when you're so eager to trust people you should doubt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take that band off, quick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The treatment wristband?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remembered why Joyce woke up when I saw the syringes in their hands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 40,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "It's this\u2014the treatment bands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones you got have been modified. There's a sensor on them similar to the equipment in Dorothy's lab. If it comes into contact with Transmitter...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to report to the director. Someone is behind all this, using... using...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_phonestop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit, communications are down again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I get it now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All this time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doc Urbica, are you okay? Are you crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crying? No, I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not important.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't over, Sonny. Dorothy was never your enemy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
